  "goodToKnow": "Bewaffnet means armed: ein bewaffneter Überfall (armed robbery), bewaffnete Konflikte, schwer bewaffnet (heavily armed). Germany has strict gun laws; owning a gun requires a licence (Waffenbesitzkarte), and police officers are among the few people who carry weapons. Bewaffnen means to arm, and sich bewaffnen to arm oneself, also humorously: mit Regenschirm bewaffnet (armed with an umbrella). From die Waffe (weapon)."
